| landing gap, extractor of record | {{w3_gap_A_judge_gt}} [{{w3_ci_lo_A}}, {{w3_ci_hi_A}}] | {{w3_gap_B_judge_gt}} [{{w3_ci_lo_B}}, {{w3_ci_hi_B}}] |
